### Health
# @name health
GET {{host}}/health

### List every todo
# @name list
GET {{host}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Todos of one note
# @name list_note
GET {{host}}/api/todos?note=projects/dev.md
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Every note in the vault
# @name notes
GET {{host}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### One todo by id (404 if unknown)
# @name one
GET {{host}}/api/todos/a1b2c3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Add a todo (goes to the inbox note)
# @name add
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Buy milk",
  "priority": "high",
  "due": "2026-10-30",
  "tags": ["errand"]
}

### Add a todo to another note (created if missing)
# @name add_to_note
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Plan the enclosure",
  "note": "projects/dongle.md"
}

### Change some fields; "due": null clears the date
# @name update
PATCH {{host}}/api/todos/a1b2c3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Reply to Marc about the invoice",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "due": null
}

### Tick it (safe to retry)
# @name complete
POST {{host}}/api/todos/a1b2c3/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete it and its line
# @name remove
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos/a1b2c3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
